    23	class RecoveryNeeded(Refused):
    24	    """The recovery mark is kept: a commit stopped after an install attempt (or could not remove its debris), or
    25	    an unfinished transaction blocks every new one. Inspect with: python records_txn.py status <state_dir>."""
